Package: gcmatrix
Type: Package
Title: Granger Causality Matrices for Multivariate Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "you@example.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes pairwise Granger causality across every pair of series
    in a multivariate time series dataset and returns the result as a labeled
    matrix - a Granger Causality Matrix - that reads like a correlation table.
    Provides stationarity testing and differencing helpers, multiple-testing
    correction across the simultaneous tests, and a p-value heatmap plotting
    method.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
